'''Lyra''' (Japanese: '''コトネ''' ''Kotone'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Switch your Active Pokémon that has damage on it with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.
}}

