==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Switch}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card is a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} rather than an {{TCGP|Item card}} and can only switch out a Pokémon with damage on it.

===Origin===
*{{ga|Lyra}} is the female [[player character]] in {{game|HeartGold and SoulSilver|s}}. Her house in [[New Bark Town]] is depicted in this card's illustration.

